   "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
   "body": "Thanks, property tests for the booleans are welcome. A few things:\n\n- Format and repository checks fail: adding `proptest` changed the dependencies, so `THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt` needs regenerating (`cargo xtask licences`, then commit the file).\n- The nightly job in `ci.yml` is a separate decision from the tests. Please split it into its own PR, so this one is just the tests.\n- Please fill in the description: what the properties assert, and how long the default case counts take on the PR shards.",
